HYP-2698 / T934 / S63 -- residual-profile automaton cone scout
Arithmetic: exact Fractions over shared-x sector-mask breakpoints.
Rule-110 lens: local finite update generates a constrained language;
do not replace the generated LRC context word by arbitrary weights.

