PART B -- pointwise miss-zeta coordinates factor multiplicatively
  checked context (4, 2, 1) at x=5/37
    Pr((1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6) all still missed) = 0
    Pr((1,) all still missed) = 131274/469567
    Pr((1, 2) all still missed) = 60000/469567
    Pr((1, 3, 5) all still missed) = 0
    Pr((4, 5, 6) all still missed) = 19436/469567
  This is the exact cone coordinate: z_x(A)=prod_i z_{i,x}(A).
  Averaging over x happens only after this product word is formed.

